# ROUTING: Choose an independent policy for each list; app and feed exits need not match.
# ORDER: Place data-source DOMAIN/IP rules before program PROCESS-NAME rules.
# GATEWAY: PROCESS-NAME identifies only processes on the Surge host, not remote LAN PCs.
# SOURCE: https://iqhelp.dtn.com/firewall-ip-addresses/
# SOURCE: https://www.sierrachart.com/index.php?l=doc/helpdetails1.php
# NOTE: Replaces the old 66.112.149.* rules with the published Chicago range; avoids routing all of dtn.com.

DOMAIN,login.interquote.com
DOMAIN,iqhelp.dtn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,iqfeed.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interquote.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ddfplus.com
